# Contact form (ADR 0009). Create a key at https://web3forms.com — it delivers
# to andersonbegossi@gmail.com. Next inlines NEXT_PUBLIC_* at `yarn build`, so
# set this before building and in the Vercel project env for Production and
# Preview. The key is public in the client bundle by design.
# Leave it unset, empty, or `placeholder` and the Contact screen hides the form.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
